# ---- bulk data packs (generated from the SDK / distributed separately) ----
# The repo ships the small catalogue data (FbExportData, basesetup, maps,
# gameplay) so a fresh clone boots the map selector. The mesh packs are
# multi-GB and are produced by the extraction pipeline from a local Portal SDK
# (or downloaded as a release data pack):
#   objmodels/  - all SDK low-poly object models (.bf6mesh, ~2.7 GB)
#   mapmesh/    - per-map low-poly terrain + assets meshes (~4.4 GB)
Plugins/BF6UnrealSDK/Source/ThirdParty/libbf6/data/objmodels/
Plugins/BF6UnrealSDK/Source/ThirdParty/libbf6/data/mapmesh/
